          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 2,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "This documentation explains how to handle breaking changes in your app using versioned channels. This approach allows you to maintain different versions of your app while ensuring users receive compatible updates."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
